NOTICE — SCOPE AND INTENT

GÖÇEBE is a migration *worksheet*, not a copying tool. It exists to help people
who move PHP / HTML / WordPress sites onto modern WordPress installations.

It does NOT grant any right to reproduce a third party's design, brand assets,
or copy. Use it only on sites you own or are authorized to migrate.

The software does not download or redistribute any website content by itself;
it inspects a source the operator supplies and writes local reports.
